{"channelId":"UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","row":["Ferrer Pediatrics",14000,"Maria Teresa Ferrer, a Doctor in Physical Therapy, is dedicated to transcending geographical barriers, empowering families and practitioners worldwide to optimize care for their children. With an unwavering commitment to advancing knowledge, she actively involves therapists in exploring innovative approaches such as Dynamic Flex Cast, Brachial Plexus Injury Treatment, Movement Inhibition Therapy, Neuro-Connection therapy, and more through comprehensive continuing education courses.\n\nHer expertise, refined over 25 years, extends to a diverse range of conditions, including Brachial Plexus Injuries, Cerebral Palsy, Cortical Vision Impairments, Spina Bifida, Stroke, and various neurological disorders. Maria Teresa's mission goes beyond clinical practice; she generously imparts valuable insights to therapists and parents through weekly tips on social media, fostering a community dedicated to integrating effective strategies into children's treatment and home care plans.","ferrerpediatrics@gmail.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:37.198Z","channelId":"UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0371ee1d0023977261f9362642708f401644507873a4294f6c08c3167b71f078","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3fbc0fab6c797cbe2adc3f504eacde2f7def6db2cfe8a386f7feed78df1709ad"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":14000,"raw":"14K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6lb_7CdKJefBqOwgCBe4fg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:37.198Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"ferrerpediatrics@gmail.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"c